            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows XP SP3 or Windows Vista SP2 or Windows 8 (both 32/64bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Pentium IV @ 3.0 GHz or AMD Athlon64 3000 + @ 1.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 2 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> nVidia GeForce 6800GT or AMD Radeon X1950 Pro (256MB VRAM with Shader Model 3.0 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 6 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Windows-compatible keyboard and mouse required, optional Microsoft XBOX360 controller or compatible Originally released for Windows 7, the game can be played on Windows 10 and Windows 11 OS</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows XP SP3 or Windows Vista SP2 or Windows 8 (both 32/64bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E4400 @ 2.0 GHz or AMD Athlon64 X2 3800+@ 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 2 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> nVidia GeForce 9600GT or higher, AMD Radeon HD3850 or higher (512MB VRAM with Shader Model 4.0)<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 6 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Windows-compatible keyboard and mouse required, optional Microsoft XBOX360 controller or compatible Originally released for Windows 7, the game can be played on Windows 10 and Windows 11 OS</li></ul>"
